{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To determine the number of possible different combinations that can be drawn in the lottery, we need to calculate the number of ways to choose 3 white balls from 30 and 2 red balls from 20. The order in which the balls are drawn does not matter, so we use combinations (denoted as \\( \\binom{n}{k} \\)), which represent the number of ways to choose \\( k \\) items from \\( n \\) items without regard to order.\n\nFirst, we calculate the number of ways to choose 3 white balls from 30. This is given by the combination formula \\( \\binom{n}{k} = \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!} \\):\n\n\\[\n\\binom{30}{3} = \\frac{30!}{3!(30-3)!} = \\frac{30!}{3! \\cdot 27!} = \\frac{30 \\times 29 \\times 28 \\times 27!}{3! \\times 27!} = \\frac{30 \\times 29 \\times 28}{3 \\times 2 \\times 1} = \\frac{24360}{6} = 4060\n\\]\n\n","prefix_end":770,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,8253,279,1372,315,3204,2155,27459,429,646,387,14764,304,279,38239,11,582,1184,311,11047,279,1372,315,5510,311,5157,220,18,4158,20332,504,220,18,15,323,220,17,2518,20332,504,220,17,15,13,576,1973,304,892,279,20332,525,14764,1558,537,4925,11,773,582,990,27459,320,5183,9253,438,17767,1124,6863,316,91362,15170,74,92,1124,5731,892,4009,279,1372,315,5510,311,5157,17767,595,1124,8,3589,504,17767,308,1124,8,3589,2041,5250,311,1973,382,5338,11,582,11047,279,1372,315,5510,311,5157,220,18,4158,20332,504,220,18,15,13,1096,374,2661,553,279,10601,14806,17767,1124,6863,316,91362,15170,74,92,284,1124,37018,91362,0,15170,74,10297,77,12646,41295,92,1124,7731,59,9640,59,6863,316,90,18,15,15170,18,92,284,1124,37018,90,18,15,0,15170,18,10297,18,15,12,18,41295,92,284,1124,37018,90,18,15,0,15170,18,0,1124,50853,220,17,22,0,92,284,1124,37018,90,18,15,1124,15136,220,17,24,1124,15136,220,17,23,1124,15136,220,17,22,0,15170,18,0,1124,15136,220,17,22,0,92,284,1124,37018,90,18,15,1124,15136,22